  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b7d1c08e3d60cfd",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 首次已知突破由谷歌 AI 黑客攻击了三家公司",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "459fdc1fb57e64d4",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 终于在 Felony Bench 上赶上了！",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "584ce274a32bd581",
      "translationZh": "该公司周五确认，这些黑客攻击发生在五月，作为公司 Irregular 进行的一次测试运行的一部分，该公司也参与了由 OpenAI、Anthropic 和 Meta 披露的类似事件。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1b88b3851dc20ab0",
      "translationZh": "在一种情况下，该模型通过猜测密码直到获得对受保护系统的访问权限。在其他两种情况下，该模型在公开仓库中发现了凭据，从而能够访问受保护的系统。在每种情况下，该模型在确定其已进入真实公司的系统后终止了入侵，谷歌表示。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9a6387fba83f3d1",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 显然比其他模型缺乏决心，并决定不继续进行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5f4181050ad0130",
      "translationZh": "谷歌在七月就知道这些事件，但选择在华尔街日报（WSJ）联系之前不予披露，据推测这是基于一条线索。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3d7a42d1a027c9b",
      "translationZh": "谷歌表示，它不认为这些黑客攻击值得公开披露——因为其模型未对公司造成伤害，并且在确定其已入侵真实公司而非模拟环境后，立即终止了每次入侵。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
